{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50300","headline":"梦到沙州奉怀殿下 · 佚名","name":"梦到沙州奉怀殿下","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一从沦陷自天涯，数度恓（原作「栖」）惶怨别家。\n将谓飘零长失路，谁知运合至流沙。\n浪漫有幸达人主，惟恨天才遇尚赊。\n日夕恩波沾雨露，纵横顾盼益光华。\n光华远近谁不羡，常思刷羽抟风便。\n忽使三冬告别离，山河万里诚难见。\n昨来魂梦傍阳关，省到敦煌奉玉颜。\n舞席歌楼似登陟，绮筳花柳记跻攀。\n总缘宿昔承言笑，此夜论心岂蹔闲。\n睡里不知回早晚，觉时只觉泪斑斑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50300.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50300","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}